Basic relationship:
Inertial frame: {[`3I], [`3J], [`3K]}
Rotational frame: {[`3i], [`3j], [`3k]}, offset [R_0], rotation axis: [\O]
Position (rotational): [r], (inertial): [R]

[r](t) fail to be smooth where d[r]/dt = 0
-> Curve: C = \S{k=1, n, C_k} with parametrization {k=1, n, [r_k]}
-> \S{1, k, \int{a_i, b_i, |d*[r_i]/dt|*dt}}

Curvature as rate of turning of unit tangent
\k > 0 on interval containing s, \D\t angle between [T](s+\D*s) and [T](s) -> \k(s) = lim{\D*s->0, (\D*\t)/(\D*s)}

[\D*T] = [T](s+\D*s) - [T](s)
-> \lim{\D*s->0, |(\D*[T])/(\D*\t)| = 1
\k(s) = \lim{\D*s->0, (\D*[T])/(\D*s)} = \lim{\D*s->0, (\D*[T])/(\D*\t)}*\lim{\D*s->0, (\D*\t)/(\D*s)} = \lim{\D*s->0, (\D*\t)/(\D*s)}
